{"id":"n25949-2-11","stage":1,"title":"경찰 · 警察","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25949-2-11-1","ko":"저기 길에 누가 쓰러져 있어. 어떻게 하지?","zh":"那边路上有人倒下了。该怎么办呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저기","meaning":"那里，那儿","explanation":"저기：那里，那儿","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}},{"text":"길에","meaning":"路上","explanation":"길：路上；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"9","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"길에","audio":"/audio/3da624f850700909d5a4.mp3"}},{"text":"누가","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누가","audio":"/audio/5f79add5f3f77de14a3d.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰러져","meaning":"倒下","explanation":"쓰러지다：倒下；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"쓰러지다","audio":"/audio/656c81f444d0c0c6fddc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16492","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰러지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓰러져","audio":"/audio/14a3440aafb14b6b9f33.mp3"}},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],